Original repository: https://github.com/apple/ml-mobileclip

This file covers code vendored into sam/modeling/text/mobile_clip.py and
sam/modeling/text/mobileclip_text_encoder.py (MobileCLIP-S0 text transformer
and text encoder wrapper).  The vendored code has been de-timm'd (timm
dependency removed) and is identified by SPDX-License-Identifier: LicenseRef-AppleML
in each file header.

Note: EfficientSAM3 uses MobileCLIP for open-vocabulary concept matching, which
involves the MobileCLIP text encoder weights distributed separately from this
code (Simon7108528/EfficientSAM3 on HuggingFace).  Using those weights is
also subject to the Apple ML Research License terms above.
